                    <SolidColorBrush x:Key="Workspace.WarningSurface">#F2E5C4</SolidColorBrush>
                    <!-- Palette review 2026-11-13: #2D4023 was a near-black olive (CIELAB chroma 20) that read as grey and sat 8 dE
                         from Error under protanopia. A clear bluish green at the same text contrast: 5.02:1 on Background, 5.66:1
                         on Panel, 4.57:1 on Raised, 6.24:1 on Card, 5.72:1 on SuccessSurface; simulated distance to Error 8.2 -> 14.4. -->
                    <SolidColorBrush x:Key="Workspace.Success">#1D6941</SolidColorBrush>
                    <SolidColorBrush x:Key="Workspace.SuccessSurface">#E8F0E4</SolidColorBrush>
                    <SolidColorBrush x:Key="Workspace.Progress">#4A2203</SolidColorBrush>
                    <!-- UX review 2026-11-13 (progress variant A): the fill is a dark accent brown one step below the pressed accent (#662F05),
                         no longer a foreign neutral grey (#333333, 3.12:1 on the track). The empty part of a bar is visible: 3.05:1 on
                         Background, 3.44:1 on Panel/Overlay, 3.79:1 on Card, and the #4A2203 fill is 3.41:1 on it (11.71:1 on Panel, 8.50:1 on Hover,
                         9.57:1 on AccentSurface). 3:1 on Raised (2.78), Hover (2.50) and AccentSurface (2.81) is not reachable together with a 3:1
                         fill: that would need a track luminance of at most 0.19 and at least 0.199. -->
                    <SolidColorBrush x:Key="Workspace.ProgressTrack">#857D74</SolidColorBrush>
